                        "Give me a moment.",
                        "I'm trying to find the right way to say something."
                    ],
                    "intro_dialogue": [
                        "Can I tell you something that's not about wells or readings?",
                        "Just — something."
                    ],
                    "success_dialogue": [
                        "We're here because Gabriella sent us.",
                        "Gabriella is Gwen's superior in the Concordat.",
                        "She's — she's very good at what she does.",
                        "What she does is consolidate power and call it order.",
                        "Gwen takes her orders and keeps about sixty percent of what they find.",
                        "The rest goes up.",
                        "I used to think that was enough.",
                        "Doing good work inside a flawed system, quietly redirecting what you can.",
                        "I still think it's the best available option.",
                        "I just — I've been watching the villages downstream of our extraction sites.",
                        "The water tastes different. The fishing has shifted.",
                        "Nobody's reported it formally because nobody's asked.",
                        "I'm asking. Internally. It's a process.",
                        "Anyway.",
                        "I wanted you to know we know.",
                        "Gwen knows. Cygwin has the data.",
                        "We're not pretending.",
                        "Come back. I have one more thing — something good this time."
                    ],
